      "originalText": "Human + Agent simultaneous inserts → BOTH survive, no data loss  •  Merge order deterministic by clientID — identical on all clients\nAgent streams tokens into Staging Y.Text → atomically commits via replace_range when done  (prevents mid-stream human/agent interleaving)\nEvery participant (human or agent) is just a Y.Doc with a unique clientID  •  Agent Y.Doc runs in-process — no extra WebSocket hop",
